THIRD-PARTY CODE
----------------
The label matcher at src/agribench/contract/matching.py is a fork of an
upstream scoring matcher; one unused production-only helper was removed and
nothing else was changed. Both the pre-fork and post-fork digests, and a note
describing the change, are recorded in
src/agribench/contract/contract.lock.json.


RIGHTS HOLDERS
--------------
If you hold the rights to an image referenced here and it should not be
referenced, open an issue at
https://github.com/kissanai/agrivision-bench/issues. The case will be
removed and the suite version bumped rather than silently edited, so that
previously published results stay auditable.
